{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在無綫節目《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）曾示範了一道用料豐富的家常靚湯——「綠豆章魚蓮藕湯」。這道湯結合了章魚的濃厚海鮮味、蓮藕的鮮甜以及綠豆「起沙」後的綿密口感，層次極為豐富，是甘香順喉的滋補首選。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"499ef44d-7abf-4ac2-93e1-3f58b48bdc2d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20268tcnNULpxq1783916353.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"499ef44d-7abf-4ac2-93e1-3f58b48bdc2d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">綠豆章魚蓮藕湯食材準備</p><p id=\"p-rc_e1e7f19651e65c21-145\" style=\"text-align: left;\">綠豆、章魚、蓮藕、豬腱、陳皮、蜜棗、水</p><p id=\"p-rc_e1e7f19651e65c21-145\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_e1e7f19651e65c21-145\" style=\"text-align: left;\">詳細烹調步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li><p id=\"p-rc_e1e7f19651e65c21-146\" style=\"text-align: left;\">綠豆洗淨後，用清水浸泡約 30 分鐘。</p></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb3daa88-67b7-47da-9d17-082ea06e7fb2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026ClRLQC0A1w1783916350.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb3daa88-67b7-47da-9d17-082ea06e7fb2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T01:18:42.058652+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}